{"data":{"body":"[P2] Update the CDK test for the additional custom resource\n\nAdding `AuroraWidenColumns` makes the default stack contain two `Custom::AWS` resources, but `cdk/stack.test.ts` still asserts `template.resourceCountIs(\"Custom::AWS\", 1)`. That assertion now fails when the CDK suite runs; the exporter package tests exclude this directory. Update the expected count and add assertions covering the migration SQL, its create/update handlers, and its dependency on table creation.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPenXVs8AAAABBDHymA","finding_digest":"c5007281874129e57a3694814664d5ce66d9189723d84bf5b636556f747d5627","finding_id":"arf_v1_yuahfamhieu6k6rwssaumzgvzz","finding_key":"telemetry-exporter/cdk/stack.ts::aurora_widen_columns::cdk-test-resource-count","identity_key":"telemetry-exporter/cdk/stack.ts::aurora_widen_columns::cdk-test-resource-count","line":263,"observation_digest":"1c9462fbc31f472c47f9b35683ca9c2eac27bfe7890080526d2a4ed8efa98433","observation_id":"aro_v1_dskgf66dd5dsyr7zwnlihsu4f2","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-telemetry-exporter/cdk/stack.ts","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_yuahfamhieu6k6rwssaumzgvzz","published_at":"2026-10-24T00:39:17Z","review_id":"arr_v1_mtjvo4rniqbsgr7pj6ca3y3kpf","reviewed_base_sha":"e049d07c3fd087b3ae891e8735d337448eb314ee","reviewed_head_sha":"8e6e01fe9926644914692efb5f9efc2db3c6c652","reviewer":"codex","start_line":261,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":1075},"record_id":"art_v1_pcqabpy3std4qlcljaagwil3sv","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-24T00:39:17Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js","id":1038735190},"schema_version":1}
